i><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"L,S\\in V\">\\(L,S\\in V\\)</span> (ladder family and its index set)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcComb8LadderSystem}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcComb8LadderSystem}_S\\)</span> (predicate defined here)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Ordinal}\">\\(\\mathrm{Ordinal}\\)</span> (ordinal predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"5582a281f15a33c2\" href=\"?note=5582a281f15a33c2\" title=\"../batch17/58-df-ordinal.md\">../batch17/58-df-ordinal.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Function}\">\\(\\mathrm{Function}\\)</span> (set-function predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"36d7463d215be751\" href=\"?note=36d7463d215be751\" title=\"../batch16/58-df-function.md\">../batch16/58-df-function.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{cf}\">\\(\\mathrm{cf}\\)</span> (cofinality function, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"315ad00b8744fdfc\" href=\"?note=315ad00b8744fdfc\" title=\"../batch13/58-df-cofinality.md\">../batch13/58-df-cofinality.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{ran}\">\\(\\operatorname{ran}\\)</span> (range operator, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-9\" data-note=\"44d32dc8fecf5e62\" href=\"?note=44d32dc8fecf5e62\" title=\"../batch09/58-df-range.md\">../batch09/58-df-range.md</a>)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}comb8\\text{-}ladder\\text{-}system} \\vdash\n\\mathrm{ZfcComb8LadderSystem}_S(L,S)\\leftrightarrow\\left(\n\\forall\\delta\\in S\\;\\mathrm{Ordinal}(\\delta)\\land\n\\mathrm{Function}(L,S,\\mathcal P(\\omega\\times\\bigcup S))\\land\n\\forall\\delta\\in S\\;\\Bigl(\n\\mathrm{cf}(\\delta)=\\omega\\land\\mathrm{Function}(L(\\delta),\\omega,\\delta)\\land\n\\forall m,n\\in\\omega\\;(m&lt;n\\to L(\\delta)(m)&lt;L(\\delta)(n))\\land\n\\sup\\operatorname{ran}(L(\\delta))=\\delta\n\\Bigr)\\right)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}comb8\\text{-}ladder\\text{-}system} \\vdash\n\\mathrm{ZfcComb8LadderSystem}_S(L,S)\\leftrightarrow\\left(\n\\forall\\delta\\in S\\;\\mathrm{Ordinal}(\\delta)\\land\n\\mathrm{Function}(L,S,\\mathcal P(\\omega\\times\\bigcup S))\\land\n\\forall\\delta\\in S\\;\\Bigl(\n\\mathrm{cf}(\\delta)=\\omega\\land\\mathrm{Function}(L(\\delta),\\omega,\\delta)\\land\n\\forall m,n\\in\\omega\\;(m&lt;n\\to L(\\delta)(m)&lt;L(\\delta)(n))\\land\n\\sup\\operatorname{ran}(L(\\delta))=\\delta\n\\Bigr)\\right)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>每个 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"L(\\delta)\">\\(L(\\delta)\\)</span> 是函数图而不是仅有值域的子集；因其图包含于 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\omega\\times\\delta\">\\(\\omega\\times\\delta\\)</span>，整个族的统一陪域取 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal P(\\omega\\times\\bigcup S)\">\\(\\mathcal P(\\omega\\times\\bigcup S)\\)</span>。序数性仍逐元素表达。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"58-ax-zfc","status":"resolved","id":"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-ax-zfc]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch16/58-df-function.md","status":"resolved","id":"36d7463d215be751","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch16/58-df-function.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch17/58-df-ordinal.md","status":"resolved","id":"5582a281f15a33c2","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch17/58-df-ordinal.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../